  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 5700 OPERATION OF THE CENTRAL REPOSITORY: CRIMINAL RECORDS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 106-B:14 and RSA 106-B:7, I(b)\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #6704, effective 3-3-98, renumbered the rules from Saf-P 400 to Saf-C 5700. The prior filings for former Saf-P 400 include the following documents:\n\n#2219, eff 12-31-82\n\n#2876, eff 10-12-84; EXPIRED 10-12-90\n\n#4982, eff 11-16-90\n\n#5360, eff 3-19-92\n\nNote that the rules in Saf-P 400 were out of effect between 10-12-90 and 11-16-90.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
